id=silence-shutter-screenshot
name=Silence Shutter, Screenshot and Headphone Warning
version=2.4
versionCode=6
author=hritwik
description=Silences the camera shutter and screenshot sound (bind-mounts a silent clip over camera_click.ogg etc. on every boot) and disables the headphone high-volume warning and its automatic volume lowering (RRO overlay turning off sound dose / safe media volume). Systemless and reversible. KernelSU: the headphone part needs a metamodule such as Hybrid Mount, and with module hiding (Umount modules / susfs) the shutter part needs "Umount modules" off for System UI -- see README.
updateJson=https://github.com/HritwikSinghal/disable_sscam_sound/releases/latest/download/update.json
